ips Campus Ministries Volunteering Living Housing and Dining Services ID Center Health and Counseling Services Transportation Campus Police & Safety Technology Community CommuniTEAMS CODE 4 STEM Academy CODE for Commonwealth & Country Community and Economic Impact Military Friendly Campus REACHland Connect Campus and Community Facilities Student Success Pitt-Johnstown Book Center Owen Library Real World Readiness Student Conduct & Judicial Affairs Winterfest 2025 Homecoming Homecoming Court Athletics Zamias Aquatic Center Wellness Center Alumni Alumni Association Board of Directors Application Packet Alumni Events Alumni Golf Classic Mountain Cat Tournament Pitt-Johnstown Success Stories Homecoming Alumni First: Pitt-Johnstown Business Directory Giving to Pitt-Johnstown Giving to Pitt-Johnstown A Message from the President Your Gift Matters Donor-Supported Funds About Pitt-Johnstown Faculty and Staff Information Faculty and Staff Information University of Pittsburgh at Johnstown faculty and staff create an energetic work environment that is dedicated to the education and preparation of our students for the real world. The links below provide valuable resources for Pitt-Johnstown employees and may be of particular interest to new team members who would like to become familiar with University policies and procedures. Faculty Faculty Resources Pitt-Johnstown Find Faculty and Staff Pitt-Johnstown Staff Association Council University My Pitt Web Portal University of Pittsburgh Website University-wide Initiative to Protect Children from Abuse Staff Policies, Procedures, and Guidelines Nondiscrimination – Complete Policy Search Committee Resources Key Online Training Links (including “Preventing Sexual Harassment,” and “Protecting Our Children”) Other Employment Information About About Pitt-Johnstown Scenic Natural Environment Mission and Vision Office of the President Maps & Directions The Johnstown Area Administrative Offices Business Office Campus and Community Board of